('Education & Training', 'EdTech Content Creator', 'edtech-content-creator',
'Create educational content — videos, courses, and digital resources — for EdTech platforms and publishers.',
'EdTech platforms need subject matter experts who can communicate complex topics clearly. UPSC aspirants are among India''s most knowledgeable people in history, polity, economy, and current affairs. Platforms like Unacademy, Byju''s, PW, and Testbook pay content creators ₹6-25 LPA.',
'[{"stage":"Entry","title":"Content Associate","years":"0-1","salary":"₹3-7 LPA","responsibilities":["Video script writing","Question bank creation","Study material writing","Content quality checks"]},{"stage":"Mid","title":"Content Manager / Educator","years":"1-3","salary":"₹7-15 LPA","responsibilities":["Course design","Video production","Curriculum development","SME coordination"]},{"stage":"Senior","title":"Content Head / Curriculum Lead","years":"3-6","salary":"₹15-30 LPA","responsibilities":["Learning product strategy","Team management","Pedagogy innovation","Platform growth"]},{"stage":"Leadership","title":"VP Content / Chief Learning Officer","years":"6+","salary":"₹30-70 LPA","responsibilities":["Content organization leadership","Platform differentiation","Publisher partnerships","AI curriculum integration"]}]',
'₹3-7 LPA', '₹7-15 LPA', '₹30-70 LPA',
ARRAY['Creative work', 'Work from home possible', 'Platform brand recognition', 'High social impact', 'Growing sector'],
'Educate millions of students across India with quality content. Bridge the gap between good aspirants and good content.',
'Work with technology leaders, pedagogical experts, and education researchers.',
'No formal teaching qualification needed. Subject matter expertise and communication skills essential.',
ARRAY['Subject matter expertise', 'Content writing', 'Video scripting', 'Instructional design', 'Research', 'Communication', 'Digital tools'],
'Your UPSC preparation is the qualification. The depth of knowledge, the ability to explain complex topics accessibly, and experience with structured learning are all directly applicable to EdTech content creation.',
2, 'Very high - EdTech industry hiring thousands of content creators',
'[{"name":"Instructional Design","provider":"ATD (Association for Talent Development)","url":"https://www.td.org","cost":"$100","duration":"Self-paced"},{"name":"Video Production Basics","provider":"YouTube Creator Academy","url":"https://creatoracademy.youtube.com","cost":"Free","duration":"Self-paced"}]',
ARRAY['Certificate in Instructional Design', 'CPLP (Certified Professional in Learning and Performance)'],
ARRAY['Script 5 video lectures on different GS topics', 'Create a 50-question quiz bank with detailed explanations', 'Design a 12-week UPSC GS curriculum'],
'[{"week":1,"title":"Platform Research","tasks":["Study Unacademy, Byju''s, PW, Testbook content quality","Create a free educator account on Unacademy","Watch 20 hours of top educators in your subjects","Note what makes great educational content"]},{"week":2,"title":"Scripting Skills","tasks":["Learn to write video scripts (opening hook, body, summary)","Write 3 scripts for GS topics","Practice reading scripts aloud","Record and review yourself"]},{"week":3,"title":"Instructional Design","tasks":["Study Bloom''s Taxonomy for learning objectives","Learn to structure a curriculum module","Practice creating learning objectives","Design a sample course outline"]},{"week":4,"title":"Apply to Platforms","tasks":["Apply to Unacademy Educator Program","Apply to Byju''s content team","Apply to PW content division","Apply to Testbook, Adda247, BYJU''s IAS"]},{"week":5,"title":"Question Bank Creation","tasks":["Create 100 MCQs with detailed explanations for one GS paper","Practice answer writing samples","Create model essays","Build question bank portfolio"]},{"week":6,"title":"Study Material Writing","tasks":["Write a comprehensive notes set for one GS topic","Format it professionally (PDF)","Get reviewed by aspirant friends","List it for free first, then premium"]},{"week":7,"title":"Video Production","tasks":["Buy basic USB mic (₹2,000-5,000)","Record first video lecture","Edit with DaVinci Resolve (free)","Publish on YouTube"]},{"week":8,"title":"Build Platform Presence","tasks":["Maintain daily uploads on one platform","Engage with student comments","Build Telegram community for your students","Cross-promote across platforms"]},{"week":9,"title":"Premium Content","tasks":["Design first paid product: crash course or test series","Price at ₹499-1999","Launch to existing audience","Collect testimonials"]},{"week":10,"title":"Publisher Outreach","tasks":["Research UPSC book publishers: McGraw Hill, Spectrum, Oxford","Pitch to be a reviewer or co-author","Submit chapters to publishers","Build author profile"]},{"week":11,"title":"Diversification","tasks":["Create English + Hindi content where possible","Explore regional language opportunities","Build content for CSE + State PSC + CAPF","Expand total addressable market"]},{"week":12,"title":"Scale","tasks":["Evaluate best platform vs independent path","Negotiate better rates with platforms","Build a team for content production","Set 6-month revenue targets"]}]',
'₹5,000-15,000 (equipment)',
'Apply to Unacademy Educator Program, Byju''s content team, Testbook, and Adda247. Also build independently on YouTube first to demonstrate capability.',
'[{"title":"Unacademy Creator","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@unacademy","channel":"Unacademy"},{"title":"Physics Wallah","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@PhysicsWallah","channel":"Physics Wallah"}]',
'[{"title":"EdTech India Podcast","url":"https://edtechindia.in/podcast","host":"EdTech founders"}]',
