r fellowships","Apply to IDSA, ISAS, Stimson Center programs","Research Konrad Adenauer Foundation, Heinrich Böll research grants","International exposure strengthens credibility"]},{"week":10,"title":"Policy Network","tasks":["Connect with former diplomats on LinkedIn","Attend Track 1.5 dialogue events when possible","Build contacts at MEA think tank interactions","Leverage UPSC civil services network for contacts"]},{"week":11,"title":"Book or Long Report","tasks":["Outline a 15,000-word research report on your specialization","Write 2 chapters","Share with senior researchers for feedback","Submit to a publisher or think tank as a working paper"]},{"week":12,"title":"Launch","tasks":["Accept best research role","Continue publishing independently","Build international network","Set 5-year research and policy influence goals"]}]',
