ics questions (DAU, retention, LTV)","Practice estimation questions","Mock interviews with PM friends or via Pramp"]},{"week":10,"title":"Target Company Research","tasks":["Deep dive into 5 target companies: product, culture, team","Identify PM job openings","Connect with PMs at target companies","Ask for referrals or informational interviews"]},{"week":11,"title":"Applications","tasks":["Apply to 20 PM roles with tailored cover letters","Leverage domain expertise prominently in applications","Use LinkedIn, Naukri, AngelList, and company portals","Follow up after 1 week"]},{"week":12,"title":"Close","tasks":["Complete any remaining PM interviews","Negotiate compensation using Levels.fyi and Glassdoor","Accept offer","Set 90-day learning plan for first PM role"]}]',
