ial systems"]},{"week":10,"title":"Scale Planning","tasks":["Design unit economics for scale","Identify key hires for growth","Plan geographic expansion","Build advisor board"]},{"week":11,"title":"Community Building","tasks":["Build a community around your cause","Leverage UPSC network for early support","Create content about your mission","Get media coverage for the problem you''re solving"]},{"week":12,"title":"Sustainable Operations","tasks":["Ensure operational sustainability","Set 1-year growth goals","Plan next funding raise","Build team for next phase"]}]',
