ply","Study negotiation positions of key parties","Build expertise on specific negotiation tracks"]},{"week":10,"title":"Network","tasks":["Attend Carbonex or similar Indian climate events","Connect with climate professionals on LinkedIn","Join Climate Action Network India (CAN-I)","Engage with international climate research community"]},{"week":11,"title":"Think Tank Applications","tasks":["Apply to TERI, CEEW, CSTEP, IISD","Apply to international climate orgs with India programs","Research climate fellowship programs","Build referral network in climate community"]},{"week":12,"title":"Launch","tasks":["Accept best research offer","Continue publishing independently","Set international engagement goals","Plan Masters in climate policy if not done"]}]',
