ARRAY['Psychometrics', 'Research methodology', 'Consulting skills', 'Facilitation', 'Data analysis', 'Assessment tools', 'Coaching'],
'UPSC preparation builds structured analytical thinking, understanding of human behavior in institutional contexts, and comprehensive reading of social psychology through GS Paper 4 (Ethics) and sociological concepts. These directly apply to organizational psychology.',
