Study OTT platforms producing Indian cultural content (Netflix India, Disney+ Hotstar)","Pitch documentary concepts to production houses","Research NFDC (National Film Development Corporation) grants"]},{"week":9,"title":"Book Proposal","tasks":["Develop a book proposal: premise, chapter outline, sample chapter","Research publishers: HarperCollins India, Aleph, Westland","Submit proposal to 3 publishers","Find a literary agent if targeting major publishers"]},{"week":10,"title":"Collaborations","tasks":["Collaborate with historians and archaeologists for deeper content","Partner with travel companies for co-created content","Guest write for history and culture newsletters","Build academic partnerships for credibility"]},{"week":11,"title":"Speaking and Events","tasks":["Speak at literary festivals about your writing","Jaipur Literature Festival, Tata Literature Live, Bangalore Literature Festival","Build speaker profile with your cultural expertise","Connect with festival organizers"]},{"week":12,"title":"Monetize","tasks":["Launch paid newsletter for cultural content","Set up Patreon for travel documentary supporters","Approach brands for sustainable travel partnerships","Calculate path to full-time creator income"]}]',
