('Creative & Unconventional', 'Exam Content Designer / Question Paper Creator', 'exam-content-designer',
'Design examinations, question banks, and assessments for educational institutions, government bodies, and EdTech platforms.',
'Examination content design is a highly specialized and growing field in India. Government exam bodies (UPSC, SSC, NTA), state PSCs, EdTech platforms, and private educational institutions constantly need experts to design rigorous, valid, and fair assessments. Who better than an ex-UPSC aspirant who understands what good examination design looks like?',
'[{"stage":"Entry","title":"Content Designer / Question Writer","years":"0-2","salary":"₹3-8 LPA","responsibilities":["MCQ and descriptive question writing","Answer key preparation","Question review and validation","Content quality checking"]},{"stage":"Mid","title":"Assessment Manager / Lead Designer","years":"2-5","salary":"₹8-18 LPA","responsibilities":["Question bank management","Item analysis","Curriculum mapping","Team coordination"]},{"stage":"Senior","title":"Assessment Director","years":"5-8","salary":"₹18-35 LPA","responsibilities":["Examination design strategy","Psychometric analysis","Standards alignment","Quality assurance leadership"]},{"stage":"Leadership","title":"Chief Assessment Officer / Exam Board Head","years":"8+","salary":"₹35-70 LPA","responsibilities":["National examination policy","Technology integration","International partnerships","Institutional representation"]}]',
'₹3-8 LPA', '₹8-18 LPA', '₹35-70 LPA',
ARRAY['Stable demand', 'Intellectual work', 'Work from home possible', 'Impactful on millions of test-takers', 'Flexible freelance options'],
'Design fair, rigorous assessments that accurately identify merit. Improve the quality of examinations that shape millions of careers.',
'Work with government examination bodies, international testing organizations, and education technology platforms.',
'Any graduate degree. Subject matter expertise in specific domains. Understanding of assessment design principles valuable.',
ARRAY['Subject matter expertise', 'Assessment design', 'Item writing', 'Data analysis', 'Attention to detail', 'Psychometrics basics', 'Research skills'],
'You have taken the UPSC exam — you understand what good questions look like, what distinguishes a well-designed paper from a poorly designed one, and how to construct answers that demonstrate genuine understanding. This insider knowledge is invaluable for examination design.',
